    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist has long neglected a villa inherited from their late father.<br>While cleaning the villa to sell it to a real estate agency, they discover a hidden code beneath the kitchen grime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the cleaning continues, more codes are uncovered.<br>While solving the mysteries of the villa and their late father, the protagonist keeps cleaning\u2014but something ominous is lurking\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/bbc625fbdd5794e12534dbe39d46cc45.poster.avif?t=1754743218\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/bbc625fbdd5794e12534dbe39d46cc45.webm?t=1754743218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/bbc625fbdd5794e12534dbe39d46cc45.mp4?t=1754743218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/343d920de0e2413fd3daac6957b5aa52.poster.avif?t=1754743218\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/343d920de0e2413fd3daac6957b5aa52.webm?t=1754743218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/343d920de0e2413fd3daac6957b5aa52.mp4?t=1754743218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Real Cleaning Items Appear in the Game</strong><br>Official Kao products such as \u201cMagiclean\u201d and \u201cQuickle\u201d are featured.<br>Some items can even be combined to unlock special cleaning techniques!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Discover Hidden Codes and Gimmicks in Each Stage</strong><br>The villa is divided into multiple stages.<br>Use your cleaning tools to uncover hidden codes and find keys to progress to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Beware the \u2018Something\u2019 That Stalks Cleaning Players</strong><br>A mysterious presence in the game reacts to subtle sounds like your cleaning and footsteps.<br>Clean the villa while avoiding this threat and aim to escape safely!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items Featured in the Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitchen Magiclean Handy Spray</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/b9441a9bb10ec5811761304fd3ff343a.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet Magiclean No-Scrub Foam Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/720cf55ec87a921450e519c2ba3a1184.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bath Magiclean Air Jet Disinfectant EX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/77e8a9480e4ff3fd0604901bb55795c2.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickle Wiper 3D Wet Sheet STRONG \u2013 Ultra Deodorizing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/2f276d2bcc17070f4691f03996740e97.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magiclean EXPOWER Water Stain Spray</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/fe83dca560db264ebab2e30ef98c8411.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Estimated Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60\u201390 minutes</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines (As of August 8, 2025)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This guideline covers rules for posting or streaming gameplay videos online. Please read carefully and proceed at your own responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Streaming and Uploading</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may stream or upload gameplay footage without prior permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uploading gameplay without commentary or reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifying game content (including via mods)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uploading content that is illegal, offensive, or violates public order and morals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infringing on third-party rights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Monetization</strong><br>Monetization is allowed only through official programs offered by platforms such as YouTube, Twitch, and Niconico (e.g., YouTube Partner Program).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Disclaimer</strong><br>We are not responsible for any troubles, damages, or disputes with third parties arising from the use of our game\u2019s content in your videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Streaming Period</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is available for a limited time until <strong>August 7, 2026</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the distribution ends, the game may no longer be accessible or playable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Videos recorded or streamed during the distribution period may remain online after the game ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support is available until <strong>August 7, 2026</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After <strong>August 8, 2026</strong>, you may still enjoy the game, but it will no longer be eligible for support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game may be taken down without prior notice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For inquiries, please contact support[@]kao-game[.]com (please remove the brackets when entering) (available weekdays 11:00\u201317:00 JST, until November 7, 2025). Response times may vary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Important Note</strong><br>Please ensure your graphics drivers are updated to the latest version before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
