le\u201d are featured.<br>Some items can even be combined to unlock special cleaning techniques!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Discover Hidden Codes and Gimmicks in Each Stage</strong><br>The villa is divided into multiple stages.<br>Use your cleaning tools to uncover hidden codes and find keys to progress to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Beware the \u2018Something\u2019 That Stalks Cleaning Players</strong><br>A mysterious presence in the game reacts to subtle sounds like your cleaning and footsteps.<br>Clean the villa while avoiding this threat and aim to escape safely!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items Featured in the Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitchen Magiclean Handy Spray</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/b9441a9bb10ec5811761304fd3ff343a.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet Magiclean No-Scrub Foam Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/720cf55ec87a921450e519c2ba3a1184.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bath Magiclean Air Jet Disinfectant EX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/77e8a9480e4ff3fd0604901bb55795c2.avif?t=1754743218\" width=1000 height=820 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickle Wiper 3D Wet Sheet STRONG \u2013 Ultra Deodorizing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833930/extras/2f276d2bcc17070f4691f03996740e97.avif?t=1